{
  "_comment": [
    "Final wiki-10m benchmark sweep with combinatorial parameter grids per algorithm.",
    "Array values expand to all valid combinations via generate-combinations.py.",
    "Configs are trimmed to ~55 index builds x 5 efSearch values = 320 runs total.",
    "Each algorithm is split into 3 param-grid groups purely to keep run count down",
    "(not because the group names imply a recall outcome -- they don't; recall buckets",
    "are determined post-hoc from measured recall by plot_pareto.py).",
    "Validated against 8RKi1j (GPU) and YprQtp (Lucene); full run = Idg0bb (320/320 OK).",
    "GPU: uploadParallelism=2, cuvsWriterThreads=16 (NN) / 32 (IVF).",
    "Lucene: uploadParallelism=8, NoMerge, ramBuffer=20GB. zz_ prefix runs after GPU.",
    "NN_DESCENT: graph degree has no recall impact at 10M; 5 pairs give Pareto curve density."
  ],
